# Paths excluded from the BNP delivery tarball built by
# `scripts/build_bnp_export.sh`. Format: one rsync-compatible pattern
# per line, blank lines and `#` comments ignored.
#
# Doctrine: the repo carries internal artifacts (audits, planning docs,
# Claude instructions) that have value in-tree but should NOT transit
# to BNP. The export script is a one-way filter; the source repo is
# untouched.

# Claude Code instructions — internal contractual posture, not for BNP.
CLAUDE.md

# Live planning docs — internal cadence, status hedging, stakeholder
# context. Replace with the README's public surface for BNP.
WEBUI-WIRING-PLAN.md
WEBUI-WIRING-WIRED.md
WEBUI-WIRING-TO-WIRE.md

# Historical audit reports — IP carrying internal names and infra
# references. Keep tracked, strip from export.
docs/audits/

# Pitch decks — meeting-specific, named in filenames, internal politics.
docs/presentations/

# Local dev artifacts (also in .gitignore but belt-and-braces).
.coverage
coverage.xml
.pytest_cache/
.scannerwork/
.venv/
.vscode/
.menezis/
.DS_Store
build/
dist/
proto/
inputs/
rag_storage/
src/twindb_lightrag_memgraph.egg-info/
src/twindb_lightrag_memgraph/webui_dist/

# Git internals (always excluded from source archives anyway, but
# explicit so the script doesn't surprise anyone).
.git/
